# Unforgiving Aim, first mode: "Destroy target creature with flying." Memnite has no flying, so it is no legal target (CR 115.1, 702.9);
# Angelic Curator flies and is destroyed. Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby pay {1}{W} for the Curator; once it and Memnite have resolved, Black
# Lotus (green) pays {2}{G} for the Aim.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Angelic Curator
Memnite
Unforgiving Aim
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

